            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "油價周五升逾2%   10月累升13%至15%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國際油價升逾2%，市場擔心美國中期選舉後伊朗局勢可能升級，加上霍爾木茲海峽有油輪遇襲，加劇供應不足的風險。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片 oil price\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/8a6d6fb35c89d9b0db4c4846f290c2c3_Iran_US_Oil_Prices_19824_FB.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片 oil price\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/8a6d6fb35c89d9b0db4c4846f290c2c3_Iran_US_Oil_Prices_19824_FB.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片 oil price</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">12月紐約期油收報104.12美元，上升2.12美元，升幅近2.1% ; 12月倫敦布蘭特期油收報每桶117.64美元，上升2.76美元，升幅2.4%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">總結10月，紐約期油累計升15.2%，布蘭特期油累計升13.6%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17085414-%e6%b2%b9%e5%83%b9%e5%91%a8%e4%ba%94%e5%8d%87%e9%80%be2-10%e6%9c%88%e7%b4%af%e5%8d%8713%e8%87%b315",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20200413-CH-oil_FB-1-1-1-1-3-1-1-1-2-3-1-1_source-ap_.jpg.webp",
