        },
        {
            "title": "歐股個別發展  德股跌221點 10月累升2.46%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">歐洲3大股市收市個別發展，主要指數升跌互見。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"歐股 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-4.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"歐股 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-4.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">歐股 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國科技股周五急挫，拖累歐洲Stoxx 600科技股指數收市下跌2.7%，但Stoxx 600收市反覆回吐0.36%，報646點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英國富時100指數收報10,729點，微升7點或0.07%。法國CAC指數報7,969點，跌幅不足1點。德國DAX指數表現較弱，收報25,818點，下跌221點，跌幅為0.85%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">總結10月份表現，歐洲主要股市普遍向上，其中英國股市累計升逾1%，德國股市全月升2.46%，法國股市則錄得0.06%的輕微升幅。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">意大利富時MIB指數收報49500點，降低1%或501點；西班牙IBEX 35指數收報18652點，下降1.09%或204點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17085360-%e6%ad%90%e8%82%a1%e5%80%8b%e5%88%a5%e7%99%bc%e5%b1%95-%e5%be%b7%e8%82%a1%e8%b7%8c221%e9%bb%9e-10%e6%9c%88%e7%b4%af%e5%8d%872-46",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250306_FI_source-web_eu-stock-1-1.png.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-31 10:48:05",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "非洲信貸評級不符還款紀錄 新機構負責人指借貸成本過高",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">非洲聯盟授權成立的新評級機構臨時負責人強調，非洲目前借貸成本遠超其還款紀錄所應有水平。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">非洲信貸評級機構（AfCRA）於10月7日在毛里裘斯成立，為一間獨立、由私營機構主導的實體。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8506088_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8506088_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8506088_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8506088_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8506088_03.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10